{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/345385946b0dbc40cc1fe44ea075abbd.avif?t=1761161637\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do you love yokai, cryptids, and monsters? Perfect! You're needed to come help take care of Yokai Park, a nostalgic game that puts you in charge of managing and decorating a sanctuary for displaced creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/600dd7c98c568a6bdf383682bd7a504f.avif?t=1761161637\" width=898 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Invite creatures to your sanctuary to live and be taken care of. As the manager of Yokai Park you'll use help from volunteers to keep your creatures happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/5b7b456e7262fc6b7a41b4bc7c6c51cb.webp?t=1761161637\" width=35 height=35 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design enclosures that meet creatures unique needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed creatures food they enjoy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up after creatures enclosures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrangle when creatures escape!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/3d799dbec025575f4efb893d359599d2.avif?t=1761161637\" width=250 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/5b7b456e7262fc6b7a41b4bc7c6c51cb.webp?t=1761161637\" width=35 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/60fb9c34ec1be045177e0c466ac9d70d.avif?t=1761161637\" width=898 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock decorations through game play that are used for both the creature enclosures and park decor alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are no limits to what you can put where, enjoy decorating a park and making it unique to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/1af0dcf73c2aac4ad19f15e8aea9b051.webp?t=1761161637\" width=35 height=35 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase objects to place in your park on a grid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place decorations with a robust system allowing for rotation, and sub-placement along each grid square</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine some objects by placing them together for maximum options!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/1af0dcf73c2aac4ad19f15e8aea9b051.webp?t=1761161637\" width=35 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/c369cd60aee293ba301e22f262d30096.avif?t=1761161637\" width=898 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become an expert at yokai and cryptids from around the world with in game research notes that help you learn about the creatures in your park!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/bfaf89211f243a2e5c93db0396eb82ab.webp?t=1761161637\" width=35 height=35 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about your creatures via research pages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use research to help inform what they need in an enclosure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed enclosures well to unlock new creatures for your sanctuary!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/e155ad05cf86f9bdecff0171b5cbeced.avif?t=1761161637\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/bfaf89211f243a2e5c93db0396eb82ab.webp?t=1761161637\" width=35 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/a6fb72d378c613c8fbab69d3f0e0d687.avif?t=1761161637\" width=898 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your design skills to manage your park and keep your creatures, volunteers, and guests happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/28c7efb72632eb0d6723d1c103ebb1ef.webp?t=1761161637\" width=35 height=35 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and manage volunteers that can perform park tasks for you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on guest needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure your park stays tidy and well organized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your resources to ensure you have enough to care for your creatures!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/28c7efb72632eb0d6723d1c103ebb1ef.webp?t=1761161637\" width=35 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/c320fbf167f6930349d5dbe4324e3207.avif?t=1761161637\" width=898 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Yokai Park is a game designed with nostalgia in mind, but that can look different for everyone! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826820/extras/1a94883a0c217790a3eb310b4fedb187.webp?t=1761161637\" width=35 height=35 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different skins and keychains for your Yokall while you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick different looks for your creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up your guests!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragrap